> explain (costs off)
> select sjc_b.a from sjc_a join sjc_b on sjc_b.a = (select min(a) from sjc_b x where x.b = sjc_a.b)
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join
  Hash Cond: ((SubPlan 2) = sjc_b.a)
  ->  Seq Scan on sjc_a
  ->  Hash
        ->  Seq Scan on sjc_b
  SubPlan 2
    ->  Result
          InitPlan 1
            ->  Limit
